{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id28278895"}, "name":{"label":"aekorps"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-10-07T17:17:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"7889694500"}, "title":{"label":"Lacks graph over time"}, "content":{"label":"Being able to see a “streak” in a horizontal bar over time as the main UI is much more powerful than this circle with super tiny number below it, at least it is for me. With a such a visually small focus on the actual NUMBER of days you’ve completed, it’s most setup so you won’t feel bad when you do fail. This app almost assumes that you’re not going to make it past a few days or a week. With the other app I use, I have streaks that are at almost 200 and will definitely go much higher.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
