{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id101221920"}, "name":{"label":"cantech"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-07-29T12:13:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"7632443555"}, "title":{"label":"OG habit app, simply the best"}, "content":{"label":"Dont be silly people, just get this one for a few bucks, tweak it a bit to make it nice and pretty and forget about the rest. Save yourself money and lets not normalize those barely functional subscription based apps. It’s hard to believe that this app only cost a few bucks. All the competition is subscription based pretty apps that doesnt have half the function of what this app has to offer. Its silly that other apps like Habit, Done, Everyday, chargin 2-5$/monthly. I get it, those apps pretty but i cant justify monthly payments for an app so basic, just good UI, that barely needs any future development. This one is different", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id133739991"}, "name":{"label":"IamZaf"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-07-28T20:23:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"7629771235"}, "title":{"label":"Nice app but Broken sync with Apple Watch."}, "content":{"label":"I bought this app specifically to be able to complete streaks from my Apple Watch. But for some reason the streaks don’t sync between my watch and my phone even though I have iCloud sync on, and have installed and re-installed the apps. Developers never got back to me about the problem when I reached out via support. Other than that the app is easy and nice to use.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
