{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1050377157"}, "name":{"label":"maxtre333"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-12-23T15:37:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.0.9"}, "id":{"label":"6786365642"}, "title":{"label":"Pay for 12"}, "content":{"label":"I paid for an app; why am I restricted to twelve habits? I want to keep track of many things and I find it frustrating that such limitations are imposed on paying customers.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1091045554"}, "name":{"label":"LeftCoastCaitlin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-12-12T20:53:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.0.9"}, "id":{"label":"6747515502"}, "title":{"label":"Effectively useless"}, "content":{"label":"This app should be great but is really frustrating. It does things of its own accord - like a thing possessed. It counts habits/tasks as completed by itself, whether you open the app or do anything. It randomly duplicated a habit and then said I had a streak longer than I’ve even owned the app, when I deleted the habit, it disappeared for a couple of days and then reappeared two days later. These things make the app effectively useless.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id362442467"}, "name":{"label":"Jxta"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-12-11T23:28:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.0.9"}, "id":{"label":"6744050161"}, "title":{"label":"Love it but I want more!"}, "content":{"label":"This app is simple yet life changing! I am more focused on building habits that I've had on my to do list for over a year and it really works. The widgets are especially helpful as they let me see whatever I choose (specific tasks or all tasks) at a glance. I love the icons and everything about the app. The one change I would make is to add more than 2 full pages. I wanted to have a page for different sections in my life (e.g. physical health, mindfulness, personal development). It narrows down your focus for sure but I want to be able to build on top of my habits instead of replacing them so I think it would be a good addition. All in all still an excellent app :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
