{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id32245129"}, "name":{"label":"star watched"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-11-01T04:53:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.0.6"}, "id":{"label":"6597212506"}, "title":{"label":"Helpful way to build positive habits"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve found Streaks to be a fun and motivating tool to help me build better habits. With work and life completely blended these days it’s been nice to use this app as a way to create structure. Not gonna lie, hitting the button on each habit when completed is also addictive!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id245988742"}, "name":{"label":"Sami H"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-10-31T09:36:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.0.5"}, "id":{"label":"6594339395"}, "title":{"label":"Great app"}, "content":{"label":"Great app to keep track of habits but I wish it had a count feature that allows you to do a certain task many times a day. For example, reading goal: 3 times a day for 10 minutes each (bonus if u can customize the intervals for each time). That feature would be useful for pomadoro too since as it stands; 1 pomodaro a day is not useful. Also would like the count feature for bad habits too, to see how many times I smoked in the day and such. I think that addition would make the app perfect but as it stands, I think it’s lacking as there is nothing enticing me to go back to the app after I’ve done my ‘goals’ for the day.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id120928967"}, "name":{"label":"S.G.B."}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-10-16T23:03:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.0.4"}, "id":{"label":"6543585822"}, "title":{"label":"Really enjoyed it until the update..."}, "content":{"label":"I really enjoyed this app (I’ve had it now for about a year) but the most recent update has really thrown me. Sometimes the app will haphazardly mis-log a task - for example, I want to log one completed time a day, it sometimes marks the whole day completed instead. It also has a tendency to completing tasks on its own without me clicking on them or crossing out the task for the day when I still have time to complete it. I don’t know if this is me misunderstanding aspects of the new update or a boatload of bugs but whatever it is, it makes the app feel pretty useless.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
